03Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐκ\">ἐκ]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τ\n                    ῶν\">[τ-]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[ῶν]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἰδίων\">ἰδίων\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐποίησεν\">[ἐποίησεν]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τόπον\">[τό]π̣ον\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἑαυτῷ\">[ἑ]α[υτῷ]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan data-text=\"καί\">καί\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τοῖς\">τοῖς\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἰδίος\">ἰδίος\u003C/span>] \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al0-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΕΝΕ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΙΝΕΣ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐκ\">..\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τ\n                    ῶν\">.]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[..]\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἰδίων\">ΙΔΙΩΝ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐποίησεν\">[........]\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τόπον\">[..].ΟΝ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἑαυτῷ\">[.]Α[...]\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al5-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>[............]\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"lines 2-3\">lines.2-3: \u003Cspan>ἐκ τ|ῶν] ἰδίων [ἐποίησεν Ferrua\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 4\">line.4: \u003Cspan>ΙΟΝ .. Α Amico, Kaibel; [τό]π̣ον [ἑ]α[υτῷ Ferrua\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"line 5\">line.5: \u003Cspan>[καὶ τοῖς ἰδίοις Ferrua\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">\u003Ca href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5187-5163\">Marta Fogagnolo\u003C/a>\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>… built it at his own expense for himself and his children.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>According to Ferrua’s restorations (1941, 243), the epitaph includes a reference to the construction of the funerary monument at the deceased's own expense, for himself and his descendants. A less likely, though still possible, restoration is \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">ἐκ τ|ῶν] ἰδίων [ἐγόρασεν\u003C/span> (cf. IG XIV 529, ll. 4–5). On the formula fecit sibis et suis, which at Catania is attested exclusively in Christian funerary inscriptions, see Ferrua 1941, 242–243.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Amico 1741 277 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kaibel 1890 \u003Ca href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">516\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Ferrua 1941 243 n.2 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001456\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001456\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  \u003C/div>",[183,186,189,192,195,198],{"id":184,"html":185},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al0-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΕΝΕ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>]ΙΝΕΣ[\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐκ\">ἐκ]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τ\n                    ῶν\">[τ-]\u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>[ῶν]\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἰδίων\">ἰδίων\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐποίησεν\">[ἐποίησεν]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τόπον\">[τό]π̣ον\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἑαυτῷ\">[ἑ]α[υτῷ]\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>[\u003Cspan data-text=\"καί\">καί\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"τοῖς\">τοῖς\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ἰδίος\">ἰδίος\u003C/